Scope. The MIT License above covers this project's own work: the Modelica
models (modelica/*.mo, modelica/MotalaDynamics, modelica/MotalaResearch), the
web app (site/src), scripts, tests and documentation.

It does not cover:

- OpenModelica. The published site bundles OpenModelica's web compiler in
  omc-web/ (staged by scripts/stage_omc.py, not part of this repository). It is
  distributed under the OSMC Public License 1.8 or the GNU AGPL version 3, at
  the recipient's choice; see omc-web/LICENSE-OpenModelica.txt and
  https://github.com/OpenModelica/OpenModelica. omc-web/manifest.json names the
  exact compiler revision.
- Source material in data/, cited in data/sources.json and the download
  manifests:
  - Motala kommun's annual reports and budgets are public documents (allmänna
    handlingar). Their images are removed (scripts/strip_pdf_images.py), since
    photos can carry third-party rights.
  - SCB and Kolada data are open data, used with attribution.
  - SKR's figures are used with attribution. SKR's workbooks are not
    redistributed; data/skr-motala/README.md links to SKR's original.
- Research papers in modelica/papers/ are not redistributed; fetch.py retrieves
  them from their publishers.
